  "question": {
    "text": "A block of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> placed inside a box descends vertically with acceleration <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>.&nbsp;The block exerts a force equal to one-fourth of its weight on the floor of the box. The value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;will be"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The forces acting on the block are shown below.</p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;is normal force&nbsp;and box is falling with acceleration&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0076_6b6eb87fe2ce.png\" style=\"width: 130px; height: 141px;\" /></p><p>From figure,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>According to question,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
